<div class="container">

<div class="card">

<h2>1. What Are Cookies?</h2>

<p>
Cookies are small text files that websites may store on a visitor's
device. They can help websites remember information and provide
certain features.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>2. How GoodLeaders May Use Cookies</h2>

<p>
GoodLeaders may use cookies or similar technologies for purposes such
as:
</p>

<ul>
<li>Keeping users signed in</li>
<li>Maintaining secure sessions</li>
<li>Remembering necessary website settings</li>
<li>Understanding how the website is used</li>
<li>Supporting website functionality</li>
</ul>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>3. Advertising Cookies and Google AdSense</h2>

<p>
GoodLeaders uses Google AdSense to display advertisements on the
website. Google and other third-party advertising vendors may use
cookies or similar technologies to serve, measure and improve
advertisements.
</p>

<p>
Third-party vendors, including Google, may use cookies to serve
advertisements based on a user's prior visits to GoodLeaders or other
websites.
</p>

<p>
Google's advertising cookies may be used to help provide relevant
advertisements, measure advertising performance and avoid repeatedly
showing the same advertisements.
</p>

<p>
Users may manage or opt out of personalized advertising through
Google's Ads Settings.
</p>

<p>
GoodLeaders' use of advertising technologies is subject to applicable
privacy and consent requirements. Visitors should also review the
GoodLeaders Privacy Policy for additional information about
advertising and data practices.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>

<p>
Some services used by GoodLeaders may place their own cookies or use
similar technologies. These services may include hosting, analytics,
advertising and other third-party tools.
</p>

<p>
Third-party services have their own privacy policies and terms.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>5. Managing Cookies</h2>

<p>
Most web browsers allow users to control or delete cookies through
their browser settings.
</p>

<p>
Disabling certain cookies may affect some features of GoodLeaders,
particularly features that require a user session.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>6. Changes to This Cookie Policy</h2>

<p>
This Cookie Policy may be updated when GoodLeaders introduces new
features, services or advertising technologies.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>7. Contact Us</h2>

<p>
If you have questions about this Cookie Policy, please contact us
through the GoodLeaders Contact Us page.
</p>

